Audited 12 zero-variance face declarations, including exact finite-subfamily deletion of the actual polyhedral distance and the polynomial CLT after deletion.
Both null projections follow from actual centered L2 moments and exact covariance; negative deleted thresholds give zero probabilities under both laws.
